contentText:
Travis Kelce scored both a huge touchdown and a viral reaction from Taylor Swift at the Sunday (Sept. 20) Kansas City Chiefs game, and in the new episode of New Heights that dropped Wednesday (Sept. 23), he reacted to the sweet moment.

